                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "As more able-bodied adults are added to Medicaid, needy and disabled Americans are being displaced from priority services.\u00a0\n\n700,000 disabled Americans are stuck on Medicaid waitlists while able-bodied adults get taxpayer-funded healthcare.\u00a0\n\nThis should not be happening. We must reform Medicaid.",
