                "retweet_count": 6,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Obamacare has done the following: \n\nOverwhelmed the Medicaid system since it became law.\u00a0\n\nShifted resources away from the vulnerable.\u00a0\n\nExpanded Medicaid coverage to millions of able-bodied adults.\u00a0\n\nObamacare led to the explosion of Medicaid. We must reform this program before it\u2019s too late.\nhttps://t.co/0wIYuLliR7",
