                "retweet_count": 153,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Democrats used Obamacare to pressure states into taking more federal dollars to expand Medicaid, flooding the program with able-bodied adults and diverting resources from the truly needy.\n\nWe must reform Medicaid and close the loopholes that allow able-bodied adults to game the system.",
