                "retweet_count": 482,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "The Swamp bill coming from the Senate needs to be rejected as it stands now, with provisions to:\n\n-Increase the deficit by $1 trillion\n-Allow illegal aliens to receive SNAP benefits\u00a0\n-Allow Green New Scam subsidies to continue\u00a0\n-Weaken Medicaid reforms to cut waste, fraud and abuse\u00a0\n-Revive a loophole to benefit foreign tobacco companies\u00a0\n-Make taxpayers pay for transgender surgeries\u00a0\u00a0\n\nThe Senate needs to honor the House\u2019s framework, overrule the parliamentarian, and rework these provisions.",
